==Faroese==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|non|fo}} {{term|líða|lang=non}}, from {{proto|Germanic|līþanan|lang=fo}}. The sense “suffer” may be borrowed from {{etyl|gml|fo}}, but derive from the same root in any case.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|[ˈlʊija]|lang=fo}}
*: {{rhymes|ʊija|lang=fo}}

===Verb===
{{infl|fo|noun}}

# to [[elapse]] (''time'')
# to [[approach]]
# to [[move]] [[smoothly]]
# to [[suffer]]

====Conjugation====
{{fo-conj-35|l|í|ð|ei|i}}

